# Density Compare
# Xenon (Xe) — real density 0.0059 g/cm³. equal masses: Xenon vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Xenon Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 110.6mm color: #429eb0 at (-20mm, 55.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
